[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892268\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891452\">1092G10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew retaining  bolts (1a) and remove flywheel protection\n(1b).</p><p>2. Fit the engine flywheel lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.898.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034272.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the crankshaft pulley.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034273.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Remove the crankshaft pulley.</p><p>Tighten the retaining bolts to the specified\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CRANKSHAFT PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the flywheel lock.</p><p>Tighten the flywheel protection retaining\nbolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892268\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891452\">1092G10</a></p>"]]